chatgpt-codex-connector[bot] 2026-10-14T12:17:48Z api/gateway_chat.py 644 commit 3de670dced
**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Include ultra in the degradation ladder**

When the shared config contains `reasoning_effort: ultra` (for example after a newer Agent/CLI writes a level this commit says the current receiver accepts), `coerce_reasoning_effort_for_model` drops it because `VALID_REASONING_EFFORTS` ends at `max`, so the real Gateway/runner call sites never reach the advertised-ultra path. Even a direct call against an unadvertised receiver misses this `effort in ladder` branch for the same reason and returns only `{"reasoning":{"enabled":true}}` instead of the promised `xhigh` fallback; add `ultra` to the authoritative/coercion ladder or explicitly map it before negotiation.

AGENTS.md reference: [AGENTS.md:L116-L118](https://github.com/nesquena/hermes-webui/blob/2245d7666e33b3878e6c6ba822d9489828e59f62/AGENTS.md#L116-L118)

